{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21190","headline":"杨子华画三首 二 · 元稹","name":"杨子华画三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皓腕卷红袖，锦韝臂苍鹗。\n故人断弦心，稚齿从禽乐。\n当年惜贵游，遗形寄丹雘。\n骨象或依稀，铅华已寥落。\n似对古人民，无复昔城郭。\n子亦观病身，色空俱寂寞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21190.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21190","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}